Korean BBQ as the zombies pounce, chew
 and bite their way through everybody.

00:11:23.516 --> 00:11:26.185
The smell of walking corpses
 and people dying

00:11:26.185 --> 00:11:29.647
horrible, bloody deaths is enough
 to scare the shit out of Mister Tough Guy

00:11:29.689 --> 00:11:31.190
as he gives up and takes off 

00:11:31.190 --> 00:11:34.777
making a makeshift ladder and begins
 climbing over the electric line.

00:11:34.777 --> 00:11:37.655
Hye-Sun tries to do the same,
 but struggles to hang on just as Mr.

00:11:37.655 --> 00:11:39.865
as Tough Guy comes back to give her a hand 

00:11:39.865 --> 00:11:41.951
