 causing her to fall HARD.

00:11:54.839 --> 00:11:58.175
You know what I have to commend Hye-Sun
 for not getting herself killed sooner.

00:11:58.175 --> 00:12:00.636
It's honestly quite impressive
 and unbelievable.

00:12:00.636 --> 00:12:03.222
Well done. She could have
 saved herself and Mr.

00:12:03.222 --> 00:12:06.016
Tough Guy if she'd chosen to climb
 in a more efficient manner

00:12:06.058 --> 00:12:07.059
using the monkey 

00:12:07.059 --> 00:12:09.520
hung technique,
 which is a climbing technique similar

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:12.231
to how monkeys climb,
 as this would have been a lot faster

00:12:12.231 --> 00:12:14.692
and more efficient,
 sparing the weight of the entire body

00:12:14.692 --> 00:12:17.069
by using the rope
 to support the legs as well.

00:12:17.111 --> 00:12:19.238
This would have prevented her
 feet from hanging,

00:12:19.238 --> 00:12:21.407
swinging like Tarzan on the monkey bars

00:12:21.407 --> 00:12:25.536
with their feet hanging was just a recipe
 for disaster and explained why only Mr.

00:12:25.536 --> 00:12:29.039
Tough Guy had the proper strength to climb
 this way. It's way harder.

00:12:29.081 --> 00:12:30.332
She made the right move on, 

00:12:30.332 --> 00:12:32.376
not waiting around,
 because even though she was

00:12:32.376 --> 00:12:34.503
at a safe vantage
 point from before waiting,

00:12:34.503 --> 00:12:38.090
there would have only increased the risk
 of potentially getting shot or injured

00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:40.509
from the already trigger
 happy police force.

00:12:40.509 --> 00:12:45.139
As they clearly have no idea what's really
 going on or who the enemy really is.

00:12:45.139 --> 00:12:47.057
After landing on the ledge from the climb, 

00:12:47.057 --> 00:12:49.393
I would have looked around the building
 first, looking through

00:12:49.393 --> 00:12:51.937
each of the accessable windows
 before making my move.

00:12:51.937 --> 00:12:55.441
And I would have taken off my clothing
 to wrap around my arm and elbow before

00:12:55.441 --> 00:12:56.442
smashing in the window. 

00:12:56.442 --> 00:12:58.736
Now, we may have taken off
 our only bit of clothing,

00:12:58.736 --> 00:13:02.323
but this layer around our arms
 could have also served as a layer of hand

00:13:02.323 --> 00:13:05.242
protection and would have allowed us
 to grab a chart of the broken window

00:13:05.242 --> 00:13:09.455
glass safely before combating the zombie
 that was in the office, giving us an edge

00:13:09.455 --> 00:13:12.124
over the zombie with our very own
 makeshift weapon.

00:13:12.166 --> 00:13:14.168
Hye-Sun was already in a sealed room.

00:13:14.168 --> 00:13:17.963
And last time I checked, zombies
 can't open doors, at least not easily.

00:13:18.005 --> 00:13:18.881
This means in theory, 

00:13:18.881 --> 00:13:21.842
I could have cleared the hallway room
 by room using the opening

00:13:21.842 --> 00:13:24.678
and closing of doors as methods
 of allowing me to safely control

00:13:24.678 --> 00:13:28.307
the entries and exits of this area
 without getting bitten by surprise.

00:13:28.349 --> 00:13:30.309
Approaching this situation more slowly 

00:13:30.309 --> 00:13:32.269
and carefully could have
 also let us sneak up 

00:13:32.269 --> 00:13:34.522
on that group of zombies
 that Hye-Sun passed.

00:13:34.522 --> 00:13:35.397
And if we wanted to, 

00:13:35.397 --> 00:13:38.859
we could have also close that door,
 trapping the zombies in the room.

00:13:38.901 --> 00:13:40.778
Hye-Sun's noisy and panicked approach 

00:13:40.778 --> 00:13:43.489
to this situation
 caused a herd of zombies to chase her.

00:13:43.489 --> 00:13:46.116
And if we failed to close the door
 to the zombies earlier,

00:13:46.116 --> 00:13:48.327
we still have another method
 of taking them out.

00:13:48.369 --> 00:13:49.870
After jumping down from the roof, 

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:52.915
Hye-Sun could have stayed put for a sec
 before crossing the scaffolding

00:13:52.915 --> 00:13:55.709
