00:15:24.381 --> 00:15:26.008
Mr. Pimp goes, searching for Hye-Sun. 

00:15:26.008 --> 00:15:29.678
Looking in all the model apartments
 until Hye-Sun comes from behind and tries

00:15:29.678 --> 00:15:31.388
