00:15:31.388 --> 00:15:34.725
But Mr. Pimp is too damn
 quick for poor old ice queen.

00:15:34.725 --> 00:15:38.812
Hye-Sun as he blocks her and beats her to
 the ground crossing Hye-Sun to pass out.

00:15:38.854 --> 00:15:41.190
Holy crap, this girl can't catch a break.

